Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-webkit-6.0 | gir1.2-webkit2-4.1, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 | gir1.2-gtk-3.0, fontconfig
Homepage: https://github.com/tkinali/VeloMD
Description: Featherweight Markdown editor with live split-pane preview
 VeloMD is a featherweight Markdown editor for Linux: source on the
 left, live preview on the right. Tabs with hot-exit session restore,
 find & replace on both panes, bilingual UI (Turkish/English),
 light/dark/system themes and six preview themes. Built on GTK4 +
 WebKit2GTK (~600 KB of vendored JS, no Electron).
